et the needs of farming and the market, Mao interjects: "Comrade Chen Yun said before that the market comes first; many opposed it then, and I did not speak; now are we not back on that track?"). Made public: 2013. Check: the book places Mao''s view only "that summer"; its source is Wang Bangzuo ([[w.bangzuo-zhongguo-gongchan-dang-tongyi]], 530–31). Check: Yang Shangkun''s diary has the closing plenary from 11 a.m. to 2 p.m., Li Fuchun on adjusting the industrial targets, Zhou Enlai on rural grain and cutting staff and Li Xiannian on oil crops and foreign trade speaking after Mao ([[w.yang-shangkun-riji]], II, 41); a time field. Check: the year made public: the diary''s day ([[w.yang-shangkun-riji]], II, 41) stands, by the 2017 edition''s front matter, in its first edition, [[w.shangkun-yang-shangkun-riji-2]] (2001), not seen. Check: Made public: the *Mao Zedong zhuan* prints the act in its 2011 text ([[w.mao-zedong-zhuan]], V, ch. 68), by its postscript first in 2003 ([[w.xianzhi-mao-zedong-zhuan-1949]]), earlier than the year given; earlier still if [[w.macfarquhar-origins-of-the-cultural]], cited here, prints it. To check: [[w.mao-zedong-sixiang-wan-1969]], 406 (cited by [[w.macfarquhar-origins-of-the-cultural]], III, 63 n.132a); [[w.gailong-dangdai-zhongguo-zhengzhi-dashidian]], 631 (cited by [[w.macfarquhar-origins-of-the-cultural]], III, 63 n.132b); [[w.lieberthal-research-guide-to-central-1989]], 118 (cited by [[w.macfarquhar-origins-of-the-cultural]], III, 63 n.132c); [[w.mao-zedong-sixiang-wan]], xia, 332–34 (cited by [[w.macfarquhar-origins-of-the-cultural]], III, 63 n.133); [[w.chenghua-zhonghua-renmin-gongheguo-zhengzhi]], 223 (cited by [[w.macfarquhar-origins-of-the-cultural]], III, 63 n.134); [[w.bangzuo-zhongguo-gongchan-dang-tongyi]], 530–31 (cited by [[w.macfarquhar-origins-of-the-cultural]], III, 235 n.10); Mao Zedong 毛泽东, speech at the Central Work Conference 中央工作会议, Peking, June 12, 1961 (record 讲话记录) (cited by [[w.mao-zedong-zhuan]], V, ch. 68 n